{
 "name": "VAOPGCPREC 01-90, Mar 16, 1990,  Presumptive Service Connection - Heriditofamilial Disease - 38 CFR \u00a7 3.309",
 "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center\">\t<span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Decision Assessment Document<br />\tVAOPGCPREC 01-90, Mar 16, 1990,&nbsp;&nbsp;Presumptive Service Connection - Heriditofamilial Disease - 38 CFR \u00a7 3.309<br />\tOffice of General Counsel Precedent Opinion</span></span></p><p>\t&nbsp;</p><p>\t<strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">What the opinion is about:</span></span></strong></p><p>\t<span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Whether service connection may be established pursuant to 38 C.F.R. \u00a7 3.309(a) when a hereditary or familial disease first becomes manifest to a compensable degree within the presumptive period following discharge from service?</span></span></p><p>\t<strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Impact on VBA:</span></span></strong></p><p>\t<span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">None.<br />\t<br />\t<strong>Summary of the facts and findings:</strong></span></span></p><p>\t<span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Service connection may be established pursuant to 38 C.F.R. \u00a7 3.309(a) when a hereditary or familial disease first becomes manifest to a compensable degree within the presumptive period following discharge from service provided the rebuttable presumption provisions of \u00a7 3.307 are satisfied.</span></span></p><p>\t<strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">References:</span></span></strong></p><p>\t<a href=\"http://www.va.gov/ogc/docs/1990/PREC_1-90.doc\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">http://www.va.gov/ogc/docs/1990/PREC_1-90.doc</span></span></a></p><p>\t&nbsp;</p><p>\t&nbsp;</p>",
